<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Les Semelles — EMPREINTE</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,700;1,900&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root { --noir: #0A0A0A; --blanc: #F5F2ED; --terre: #C47A3A; --vert: #2E5C3A; --gris: #888; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--blanc); color: var(--noir); overflow-x: hidden; cursor: none; }
    .cursor { width: 10px; height: 10px; background: var(--terre); border-radius: 50%; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); transition: width .2s,height .2s; }
    .cursor-ring { width: 36px; height: 36px; border: 1px solid rgba(196,122,58,.5); border-radius: 50%; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 9998; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); transition: all .12s ease-out; }

    nav { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 500; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 40px; height: 64px; background: rgba(10,10,10,.92); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a; }
    .nav-logo { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blanc); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-center{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;}
    .nav-link{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(245,242,237,.5);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s;}
    .nav-link:hover,.nav-link.active{color:var(--blanc);}
    .nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;}
    .nav-icon{width:40px;height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:rgba(245,242,237,.6);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s;position:relative;}
    .nav-icon:hover{color:var(--blanc);}
    .cart-badge{background:var(--terre);color:#fff;border-radius:50%;width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:8px;font-weight:900;position:absolute;top:5px;right:3px;}

    /* HERO */
    .hero { height: 100vh; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; }
    .hero-img { position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?w=1800&q=85&fit=crop&crop=center'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; }
    .hero-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10,10,10,.92) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,.15) 60%, transparent 100%); }
    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding: 0 64px 80px; width: 100%; }
    .hero-eyebrow { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--terre); margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .hero-eyebrow::before { content: ''; display: block; width: 28px; height: 1px; background: var(--terre); }
    .hero h1 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(80px, 12vw, 160px); line-height: .88; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blanc); letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .hero-sub { font-size: 16px; color: rgba(245,242,237,.55); max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 300; }

    /* TICKER */
    .ticker { background: var(--noir); overflow: hidden; padding: 14px 0; }
    .ticker-track { display: flex; animation: ticker 24s linear infinite; width: max-content; }
    .ticker-item { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(245,242,237,.4); padding: 0 40px; white-space: nowrap; }
    .ticker-item span { color: var(--terre); }
    @keyframes ticker { 0% { transform: translateX(0); } 100% { transform: translateX(-50%); } }

    /* INTRO */
    .intro { padding: 100px 64px 60px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(10,10,10,.1); }
    .intro h2 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(52px, 6vw, 80px); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: .95; color: var(--noir); }
    .intro h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--terre); }
    .intro p { font-size: 15px; color: #777; max-width: 340px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: right; font-weight: 300; }

    /* SEMELLES FULL */
    .semelle-full { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; min-height: 85vh; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(10,10,10,.08); }
    .semelle-full.reverse { direction: rtl; }
    .semelle-full.reverse > * { direction: ltr; }
    .semelle-photo { overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
    .semelle-photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform .8s ease; }
    .semelle-full:hover .semelle-photo img { transform: scale(1.04); }
    .semelle-num-overlay { position: absolute; top: 32px; left: 32px; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 300; font-size: 80px; line-height: 1; color: rgba(245,242,237,.15); pointer-events: none; }
    .semelle-tag-overlay { position: absolute; bottom: 32px; left: 32px; }
    .semelle-type { display: inline-block; background: var(--terre); color: var(--blanc); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .semelle-name-overlay { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 48px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blanc); line-height: .95; }

    .semelle-content { padding: 72px 56px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; background: var(--blanc); }
    .semelle-full:nth-child(even) .semelle-content { background: #EFECE5; }
    .s-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--vert); margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .s-title { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(44px, 4vw, 60px); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: .95; color: var(--noir); margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .s-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--terre); }
    .s-desc { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: #666; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .s-specs { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .s-spec { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 13px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(10,10,10,.07); font-size: 13px; }
    .s-spec:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .s-spec-k { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .07em; color: #aaa; }
    .s-spec-v { font-weight: 600; color: var(--noir); }
    .s-foot { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(10,10,10,.08); }
    .s-price { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 40px; color: var(--noir); }
    .s-add { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; background: var(--noir); color: var(--blanc); border: none; padding: 14px 28px; cursor: none; transition: background .2s; }
    .s-add:hover { background: var(--terre); }

    /* COMPARAISON */
    .comparaison { padding: 100px 64px; background: var(--noir); }
    .comp-header { margin-bottom: 56px; text-align: center; }
    .comp-header h2 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(44px, 5vw, 68px); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blanc); line-height: .95; }
    .comp-header h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--terre); }
    .comp-header p { font-size: 14px; color: #555; margin-top: 14px; max-width: 440px; margin-inline: auto; line-height: 1.7; }

    .comp-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .comp-table th { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e; text-align: left; }
    .comp-table th:first-child { color: #444; }
    .comp-table th:not(:first-child) { color: var(--vert); text-align: center; }
    .comp-table td { padding: 16px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #141414; font-size: 13px; color: #666; }
    .comp-table td:first-child { color: #888; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .comp-table td:not(:first-child) { text-align: center; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(245,242,237,.7); }
    .comp-table tr:hover td { background: rgba(255,255,255,.02); }
    .check { color: var(--vert); font-size: 18px; }
    .dot { color: #333; font-size: 18px; }
    .partial { color: var(--terre); font-size: 18px; }

    /* GUIDE */
    .guide { padding: 100px 64px; background: var(--blanc); }
    .guide-header { margin-bottom: 56px; }
    .guide-header h2 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(44px, 5vw, 68px); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: .95; color: var(--noir); }
    .guide-header h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--terre); }
    .guide-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2px; background: rgba(10,10,10,.08); }
    .guide-card { background: var(--blanc); padding: 40px 32px; }
    .guide-card .terrain { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--vert); margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .guide-card h4 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 26px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--noir); margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .guide-card ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
    .guide-card ul li { font-size: 13px; color: #777; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .guide-card ul li::before { content: '—'; color: var(--terre); flex-shrink: 0; }

    /* CTA */
    .cta-band { background: var(--noir); padding: 80px 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .cta-band h3 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blanc); line-height: .95; }
    .cta-band h3 em { color: var(--terre); font-style: normal; }
    .btn-cta { display: inline-block; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; background: var(--terre); color: var(--blanc); padding: 16px 40px; transition: background .2s; white-space: nowrap; }
    .btn-cta:hover { background: #a8642e; }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer { background: var(--noir); padding: 80px 64px 48px; border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a; }
    .footer-top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; margin-bottom: 64px; padding-bottom: 64px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a; }
    .footer-logo { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blanc); display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-logo span { color: var(--terre); }
    .footer-tagline { font-size: 13px; color: #444; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 220px; }
    .footer-col h5 { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #444; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .footer-col ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
    .footer-col ul li a { font-size: 14px; color: #555; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s; }
    .footer-col ul li a:hover { color: var(--blanc); }
    .footer-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .footer-copy { font-size: 11px; color: #333; }
    .footer-socials { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
    .fsocial { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #444; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s; }
    .fsocial:hover { color: var(--blanc); }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      nav { padding: 0 20px; }
      .nav-center .nav-link { display: none; }
      .hero-content { padding: 0 24px 56px; }
      .intro { flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; padding: 64px 24px 40px; }
      .intro p { text-align: left; }
      .semelle-full { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .semelle-full.reverse { direction: ltr; }
      .semelle-photo { height: 55vh; }
      .semelle-content { padding: 40px 24px; }
      .comparaison { padding: 64px 24px; }
      .guide { padding: 64px 24px; }
      .guide-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cta-band { flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; padding: 64px 24px; }
      footer { padding: 64px 24px 40px; }
      .footer-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="cursor" id="cursor"></div>
  <div class="cursor-ring" id="cursorRing"></div>

  <nav>
    <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Empreinte</a>
    <div class="nav-center">
      <a href="/pages/chaussure" class="nav-link">La Chaussure</a>
      <a href="/pages/semelles" class="nav-link active">Les Semelles</a>
      <a href="/pages/technologie" class="nav-link">Technologie</a>
      <a href="/pages/commander" class="nav-link">Produits</a>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-right">
      <a href="/pages/compte" class="nav-icon" title="Mon compte"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 20c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7"/></svg></a>
      <a href="/pages/commander" class="nav-icon" title="Panier"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V6l-3-4z"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 01-8 0"/></svg><span class="cart-badge" id="navBadge" style="display:none"></span></a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-img"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">Gamme modulable — 3 semelles</div>
      <h1>Les<br>semelles.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Chaque semelle pèse 60g et change le comportement de ta chaussure en 10 secondes. Trois terrains. Un seul équipement.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="ticker">
    <div class="ticker-track">
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Route &amp; Urbain</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Chemin Sec</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Boue &amp; Technique</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> 60g par semelle</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Compatible toutes bases EMPREINTE</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Changement en 10 secondes</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Route &amp; Urbain</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Chemin Sec</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Boue &amp; Technique</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> 60g par semelle</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Compatible toutes bases EMPREINTE</span>
      <span class="ticker-item"><span>✦</span> Changement en 10 secondes</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="intro">
    <h2>Trois semelles.<br><em>Tous les terrains.</em></h2>
    <p>Chaque semelle a été conçue pour un usage précis. La gomme, la hauteur et le motif des crampons sont optimisés pour la surface correspondante.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- SEMELLE 01 -->
  <div class="semelle-full" id="route">
    <div class="semelle-photo">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476480862126-209bfaa8edc8?w=900&q=85&fit=crop" alt="Running route ville" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="semelle-num-overlay">01</div>
      <div class="semelle-tag-overlay">
        <div class="semelle-type">Semelle 01</div>
        <div class="semelle-name-overlay">Route<br>&amp; Urbain</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="semelle-content">
      <div class="s-label">Terrain — Bitume · Parcs · Pistes</div>
      <h2 class="s-title">Légère.<br><em>Rapide.</em><br>Silencieuse.</h2>
      <p class="s-desc">Conçue pour le bitume, les parcs et les pistes cyclables. La gomme lisse et dense absorbe les impacts sur sol dur tout en offrant une restitution d'énergie maximale. Les micro-rainures assurent l'évacuation de l'eau par temps de pluie sans créer de résistance.</p>
      <div class="s-specs">
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Terrain idéal</span><span class="s-spec-v">Bitume, parcs, pistes</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Type de gomme</span><span class="s-spec-v">Lisse haute densité</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Rainures</span><span class="s-spec-v">Micro-canaux évacuation eau</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Hauteur crampons</span><span class="s-spec-v">0mm — Semelle lisse</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Poids</span><span class="s-spec-v">60g</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="s-foot">
        <div class="s-price">29€</div>
        <a href="/pages/commander" class="s-add" style="text-decoration:none;">Voir la fiche →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SEMELLE 02 -->
  <div class="semelle-full reverse" id="chemin">
    <div class="semelle-photo">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?w=900&q=85&fit=crop" alt="Forêt sentier" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="semelle-num-overlay">02</div>
      <div class="semelle-tag-overlay">
        <div class="semelle-type">Semelle 02</div>
        <div class="semelle-name-overlay">Chemin<br>Sec</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="semelle-content">
      <div class="s-label">Terrain — Forêt · Terre · Graviers</div>
      <h2 class="s-title">Accroche.<br><em>Précision.</em><br>Polyvalence.</h2>
      <p class="s-desc">Les crampons de 3mm en motif étoile offrent une accroche multidirectionnelle sur les sentiers forestiers, terres battues et chemins de gravier. La gomme polyvalente fonctionne aussi bien sur sol sec que légèrement humide.</p>
      <div class="s-specs">
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Terrain idéal</span><span class="s-spec-v">Forêt, sentiers, gravier</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Hauteur crampons</span><span class="s-spec-v">3mm — Motif étoile</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Type de gomme</span><span class="s-spec-v">Polyvalente haute accroche</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Direction accroche</span><span class="s-spec-v">Multidirectionnelle</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Poids</span><span class="s-spec-v">60g</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="s-foot">
        <div class="s-price">29€</div>
        <a href="/pages/commander" class="s-add" style="text-decoration:none;">Voir la fiche →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SEMELLE 03 -->
  <div class="semelle-full" id="boue">
    <div class="semelle-photo">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454496522488-7a8e488e8606?w=900&q=85&fit=crop" alt="Montagne technique" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="semelle-num-overlay">03</div>
      <div class="semelle-tag-overlay">
        <div class="semelle-type">Semelle 03</div>
        <div class="semelle-name-overlay">Boue &amp;<br>Technique</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="semelle-content">
      <div class="s-label">Terrain — Montagne · Herbe · Marécages</div>
      <h2 class="s-title">Mordant.<br><em>Auto-nettoyant.</em><br>Extrême.</h2>
      <p class="s-desc">Les crampons profonds de 6mm sont espacés de façon à permettre l'auto-nettoyage naturel à chaque foulée. La boue se détache d'elle-même sous la pression, sans s'accumuler sous la chaussure. Conçue pour les terrains les plus techniques.</p>
      <div class="s-specs">
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Terrain idéal</span><span class="s-spec-v">Montagne, herbe, marécages</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Hauteur crampons</span><span class="s-spec-v">6mm — Espacement large</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Auto-nettoyage</span><span class="s-spec-v">Naturel par espacement</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Gomme</span><span class="s-spec-v">Soft compound haute adhérence</span></div>
        <div class="s-spec"><span class="s-spec-k">Poids</span><span class="s-spec-v">60g</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="s-foot">
        <div class="s-price">29€</div>
        <a href="/pages/commander" class="s-add" style="text-decoration:none;">Voir la fiche →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- COMPARAISON -->
  <section class="comparaison">
    <div class="comp-header">
      <h2>Quelle semelle<br><em>pour quel terrain ?</em></h2>
      <p>Un tableau comparatif pour choisir rapidement la semelle adaptée à ta prochaine sortie.</p>
    </div>
    <table class="comp-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Terrain</th>
